Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.64,0:00:06.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is Trigun.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.64,0:00:32.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.36,0:01:54.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right, he's the man with the\N60 billion double dollars on his head.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.48,0:01:58.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They say he showed up in Dankentown\Nrecently, made quite a mess, I hear.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.48,0:01:59.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Heh, so what happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.44,0:02:03.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The whole town got zapped.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.42,0:02:06.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mountains of corpses all over Dankin.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.22,0:02:10.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The coffin maker got so rich, he\Nbuilt himself a mansion of wood.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.38,0:02:13.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guy sounds plain crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.44,0:02:15.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's more than crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.54,0:02:18.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think we'd be wise to\Nkeep a safe distance.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.40,0:02:21.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Messing with Vash is\Nlike dancing with death.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.16,0:02:24.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He leaves a trail of\Ndestruction wherever he goes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.66,0:02:26.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Women, children, he don't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.92,0:02:28.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He'll kill them all.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.80,0:02:31.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They call him the humanoid typhoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.24,0:03:13.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.04,0:03:21.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,know.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.12,0:03:58.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I finally found you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.12,0:04:23.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One night.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.18,0:04:25.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And just look at this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.72,0:04:28.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't believe the rumors, but\Nthis guy really is a typhoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.94,0:04:31.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Over half the town ain't\Nnothing but rubble now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.42,0:04:35.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's real shame, but the\NUndertakers must be happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.04,0:04:37.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So how many did he get this time?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.00,0:04:39.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One hundred? Two hundred?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.20,0:04:41.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Actually, zero.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.90,0:04:45.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's a whole lot of injuries,\Nbut somehow no fatalities at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.14,0:04:47.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess we had a miracle here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.38,0:04:49.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Without God's help.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.02,0:04:51.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So what was he like?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.86,0:04:56.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, he wore red, had earrings,\Na giant man with short legs.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.08,0:05:00.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid I didn't get a\Nreal good look at him myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.94,0:05:01.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Sheriff.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.20,0:05:05.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whatever you do, stay away from him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.46,0:05:07.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For your own good. Red.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.12,0:05:12.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The area of Dankin is mostly demolished.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.52,0:05:15.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All residents go to your\Ndesignated shelter areas.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.80,0:05:17.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The next update will be 4:30 p.m.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.06,0:05:21.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Until then, please enjoy\Nour musical selection.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.38,0:05:38.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you have?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.42,0:05:41.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A banana sundae. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.68,0:05:44.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I will have a Kaite\NMilly foie with Ceylon tea.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.02,0:05:49.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.93,0:05:53.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Miss, I'm afraid you'd better order milk\Nwith that or that gag ain't gonna work.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.38,0:05:57.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, cause if you did, we'd give you\Nall the milk you could possibly want.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.10,0:06:00.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Although I hate to tell you,\Nbut it wouldn't exactly be free.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.76,0:06:04.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I didn't say milk, I said Ceylon-T.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.40,0:06:08.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.88,0:06:09.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.28,0:06:11.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You little bitch, you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.74,0:06:16.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.78,0:06:18.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My leg broke again.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.46,0:06:19.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have a spare, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.94,0:06:21.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should be more careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.24,0:06:22.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.15,0:06:23.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.08,0:06:24.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's a monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.04,0:06:29.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By the way, mister, we heard that Vash the\NStampede showed up in Felnarl recently.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.48,0:06:31.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is there anything you can tell us?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.28,0:06:32.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What about Bash?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.62,0:06:33.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And why are you asking?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.06,0:06:35.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me you two\Ninnocent-looking things
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.98,0:06:38.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,are after that $60 billion\Ndouble-dollar reward.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.84,0:06:39.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.02,0:06:43.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, actually, we're just\Npassing through here on business.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.84,0:06:44.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Business?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.75,0:06:46.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I didn't exactly see him myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.94,0:06:50.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As far as I could tell, he was\Ngone from the city by dawn.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.92,0:06:53.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Last I heard, he was\Nheaded out to the east.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.40,0:06:54.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can you tell me any more about him?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.98,0:07:00.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm, well he stands about\N12 feet tall and he wields
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.72,0:07:03.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a huge weapon he's supposed\Nto have a mohawk and nerves
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.98,0:07:08.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of steel apparently he's\Ngot tons of henchmen and a
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.60,0:07:11.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,reputation is the worst\Nwomanizer anyone's ever seen?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.22,0:07:18.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Womanizer I heard what he said huge\Nweapon and a mohawk that's our man all!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.78,0:07:23.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.69,0:07:24.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.61,0:07:25.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where the hell did he go?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.82,0:07:28.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't care if you\Nhave to dig up the whole
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.30,0:07:31.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,area.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.21,0:07:32.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want you to find him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.24,0:07:33.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.15,0:07:34.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That little coward couldn't be him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.24,0:07:35.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.70,0:07:38.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,see any point sticking around this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.60,0:07:39.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's just move on.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.56,0:07:43.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you think you're big enough to give\Nme orders now, you little weasel, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.30,0:07:44.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You saw what he was wearing?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.94,0:07:45.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.00,0:07:46.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know that it's him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.02,0:07:50.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Find him no matter what or I'll\Nhave to break your neck, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.38,0:08:01.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought I was going to\Nsuffocate a minute there.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.30,0:08:02.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's fast, boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.16,0:08:06.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hi there! Pardon me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.28,0:08:08.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks for nothing, fellas.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.46,0:08:24.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was a pretty close one.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.26,0:08:26.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I almost bought the farm back there.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.20,0:08:28.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's actually a miracle that\NI got away with it this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.00,0:08:29.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I found him!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.91,0:08:30.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.82,0:08:34.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Perfect shot!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.42,0:08:42.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, he thinks he's funny.\NHunt him down. Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.14,0:08:49.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm getting hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.52,0:08:52.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're persistent.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.66,0:08:57.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ha ha ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.22,0:09:00.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm like a sitting duck over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.30,0:09:01.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm defenseless.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.50,0:09:08.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.74,0:09:10.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, stand real still.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.54,0:09:13.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You wouldn't want this\Ngun to go off, would you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.18,0:09:14.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I found him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.22,0:09:15.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's right over here boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.90,0:09:18.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, would you mind lowering\Nyour gun like a good boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.00,0:09:21.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Forget it! You don't like pain, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.62,0:09:22.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm used to it. Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.14,0:09:25.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I feel sorry for your wife\Nand kids You'll make them cry
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.36,0:09:28.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,ain't got no kids and most\Nwomen find me pretty offensive.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.52,0:09:31.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I'm single sounds\Nlike a pretty lonely life
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.08,0:09:33.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm telling you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.26,0:09:36.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have to die!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.48,0:09:39.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It would sure make us all happy if you do!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.96,0:09:43.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, I don't do requests.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.46,0:09:45.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get down!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.14,0:09:54.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boss!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.05,0:09:55.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.68,0:09:59.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's good work. My compliments.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.06,0:10:03.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Attacking while your pal\Nis in the line of fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.28,0:10:05.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you care about him at all?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.26,0:10:06.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're not pals.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.74,0:10:08.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our fate is our being partners.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.82,0:10:12.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The only possible way he can\Nbe happy is when I'm happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.26,0:10:13.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's just beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.26,0:10:16.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can shoot me if that'd\Nmake you feel better.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.90,0:10:19.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That is, if your big gun of\Nyours isn't just for show.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.86,0:10:21.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Actually, I can't stand blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.48,0:10:24.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just the very side of it\Nmakes me feel a little faint.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.18,0:10:25.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fine, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.24,0:10:29.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How about we find out what happens when\Nyou get to see your own blood, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.22,0:10:33.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, it would make me real\Nhappy if you go hold him down.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.80,0:10:41.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.92,0:10:43.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you see how devoted he is?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.08,0:10:49.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, couldn't you guys be\Njust a little bit more gentle?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.46,0:10:54.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alright, let's get our precious\Nlittle cargo to the feds right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.06,0:10:59.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we're gonna be filthy rich!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.78,0:11:06.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Women?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.69,0:11:08.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are they friends of his?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.32,0:11:11.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, are they gonna try\Nand steal our reward?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.54,0:11:13.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're going in.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.22,0:11:15.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.78,0:11:29.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now what do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.08,0:11:30.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm very pleased to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.12,0:11:32.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My name is Meryl.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.24,0:11:37.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm Meryl Stryfe and I'm here representing\Nthe Bernardelli Insurance Society.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.84,0:11:39.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I'm Millie Thompson.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.78,0:11:42.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is a small token of our goodwill.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.62,0:11:44.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nice going, Meryl!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.42,0:11:46.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.94,0:11:48.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you here with him?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.46,0:11:51.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Actually, not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.96,0:11:56.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We were sent here by the Bernardelli\NInsurance Society to investigate a report of -
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.84,0:12:02.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I finally found you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.00,0:12:06.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the 60 billion dollar big bounty. Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.64,0:12:08.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vash the Stampede. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.42,0:12:10.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.48,0:12:11.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My name is Luce Ruth,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.04,0:12:15.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm a bounty hunter, and some\Npeople know me as Constance Rifle.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.78,0:12:17.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.69,0:12:20.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vash the Stampede, time you know that\NI'm here for the price on your head.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.00,0:12:21.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.94,0:12:22.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, Merrill?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.02,0:12:23.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This looks bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.60,0:12:26.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, did I miss something?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.50,0:12:39.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.41,0:12:42.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vash the Stampede, it's\Na privilege to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.46,0:12:46.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your face is starting to look like\Nit belongs on the double dollar.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.18,0:12:48.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You really can't blame me\Nfor coming after you now,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.80,0:12:50.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,since your head is worth 60 billion.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.32,0:12:52.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do we do, Meryl?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.86,0:12:54.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think it's pretty obvious.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.70,0:12:56.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've gotta... stop them.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.48,0:12:58.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, did you say your name was Ruth?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.50,0:12:59.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, could you excuse me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.84,0:13:02.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm glad to see\Nyou enjoy your work, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.22,0:13:04.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ruth, but I'm afraid that\Nyou're just a little bit late.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.74,0:13:06.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, listen to me! Me, late?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.02,0:13:08.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't reckon so.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.68,0:13:11.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You asshole!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.86,0:13:13.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell do you\Nthink you're aiming at?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.66,0:13:16.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just a sixty billion double\Ndollar skull, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.34,0:13:17.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't be a moron!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.46,0:13:20.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You think the boss is Vash?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.00,0:13:23.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where the hell did you get that idea?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.44,0:13:26.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I ain't fool enough to\Nlisten to some lame henchman.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.62,0:13:28.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, joke's over and I ain't laughing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.92,0:13:30.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh, this is just stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.66,0:13:31.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Quit wasting my time.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.06,0:13:33.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get the hell out of it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.16,0:13:33.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't move.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.07,0:13:37.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're dressed in a red coat, you've\Ngot earrings, and your legs are short.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.86,0:13:40.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm convinced you are Vash the Stampede.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.48,0:13:41.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're out of your mind!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.22,0:13:46.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vash is a blond-haired man in a red coat,\Nand he carries a great big handgun, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.86,0:13:47.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, he isn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.96,0:13:52.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vash the Stampede is a giant man with\Na really huge weapon and a mohawk!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.60,0:13:54.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's awfully strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.36,0:13:56.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, the rumors don't match.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.04,0:13:58.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So what do we do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.36,0:13:59.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do we do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.50,0:14:01.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have no choice but to\Nbelieve what we've heard.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.82,0:14:02.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But Meryl...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.00,0:14:05.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're all crazy!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.22,0:14:07.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not Vash! Hey, boss! Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.80,0:14:12.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Feds pay 60 billion double dollars\Nfor Vash the Stampede, dead or alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.64,0:14:14.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So it's your choice, friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.02,0:14:17.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd be happy to kill you now, if you like.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.20,0:14:19.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So he's blonde.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.54,0:14:21.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Has a red coat, a big gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.24,0:14:24.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.28,0:14:26.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're trying to get the\Njump on me, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.56,0:14:29.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vash the Stampede! What'd he say?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.08,0:14:32.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You even came up with\Nthat stupid fake name!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.56,0:14:33.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nice touch!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.47,0:14:34.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.14,0:14:37.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He is definitely the real thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.32,0:14:38.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's get him!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.58,0:14:40.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm. Well, I'll be.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.06,0:14:43.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So this is how he stayed alive this long.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.40,0:14:47.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, shoot!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.06,0:14:57.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.86,0:14:59.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't push your luck!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.80,0:15:09.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm really scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.14,0:15:12.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Humanoid typeset is on the loose.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.18,0:15:13.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do we do, Meryl?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.22,0:15:15.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do we do? Duh.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.68,0:15:17.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We run away, that's what.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.48,0:15:20.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess it is important\Nto stay alive, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.42,0:15:25.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll have to get the town the\Nevacuation order immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.02,0:15:30.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But Meryl, isn't running away like this\Nthe same as if we were abandoning our post?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.64,0:15:33.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's more important that\Nwe contact the town now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.14,0:15:34.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mmm, these are really good!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.70,0:15:36.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When did you get here?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.14,0:15:37.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks a lot!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.05,0:15:39.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm really getting hungry!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.18,0:15:40.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These donuts hit the spot!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.42,0:15:41.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give me those!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.24,0:15:45.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, we didn't come out here\Njust to save your sorry butt!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.50,0:15:48.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, then, what were you two doing there?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.48,0:15:49.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are ugly donuts like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.64,0:15:50.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're tight for what?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.70,0:15:51.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.61,0:15:52.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not like that at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.60,0:15:54.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We came to this place\Non official business!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.62,0:15:55.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.53,0:15:57.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Official representatives of the\NBernardelli Insurance Society!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.86,0:15:59.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're disaster investigators!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.50,0:16:00.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, if you're really insurance people,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.92,0:16:03.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why are you so interested\Nin such a dangerous bounty?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.44,0:16:06.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's been over 300 incidents\Ninvolving Vash the Stampede.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.36,0:16:09.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a huge liability for\Nany insurance company.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.46,0:16:11.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gotta understand risks.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.62,0:16:14.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Insurance company takes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.14,0:16:15.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that must be rough.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.76,0:16:17.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like you care.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.20,0:16:20.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why we have to\Nfind Vash the Stampede
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.18,0:16:22.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and keep him under 24 hours surveillance.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.30,0:16:24.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the only way to\Nprevent further damage.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.78,0:16:25.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,24 hours?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.02,0:16:28.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is something wrong? No, nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.04,0:16:30.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.84,0:16:35.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alright, I'm prepared to make you a deal\Nin exchange for this and the donuts!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.46,0:16:37.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would you consider going into\Ntown and warning the people?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.88,0:16:39.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll even lend you my own personal Thomas.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.94,0:16:41.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you actually going back there?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.50,0:16:42.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the job.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.41,0:16:43.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's what I do
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.62,0:16:53.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like it's all over.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.98,0:16:56.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good, there don't seem\Nto be any casualties?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.24,0:16:58.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But Meryl, didn't that\Nbounty hunter get killed?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.76,0:17:02.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd call that a casualty.\NThat's true. It's very sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.60,0:17:04.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, how are we going to\Napproach him this time?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.78,0:17:06.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have you got some kind of plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.02,0:17:09.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, the deluxe box of 30.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.08,0:17:10.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, what a great idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.94,0:17:13.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As long as we're clever about this and\Ntreat them with courtesy and respect,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.80,0:17:15.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we have nothing to fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.30,0:17:24.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've got a lot of\Nnerve coming back here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.52,0:17:26.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please accept this token of goodwill.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.14,0:17:28.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hate prisons.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.50,0:17:30.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, where's the guy you ran away with?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.38,0:17:31.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.70,0:17:32.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We split up halfway.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.34,0:17:35.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And it was so damn hard to track him down.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.86,0:17:38.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell are we\Ngonna do about this, Ruth?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.18,0:17:39.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.09,0:17:40.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How can you still be alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.72,0:17:42.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought you two were\Nfighting to the death.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.66,0:17:45.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It looks as though we\Nboth made a little error.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.18,0:17:46.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We made the error?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.44,0:17:49.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In my opinion, you're the one\Nthat screwed up, it wasn't me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.94,0:17:50.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.85,0:17:52.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're gonna split it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.08,0:17:53.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,70-30.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.88,0:17:55.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And don't you forget it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.76,0:17:57.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is all this about?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.72,0:17:58.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.20,0:18:00.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on just a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.14,0:18:05.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, Meryl.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.44,0:18:08.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess I never should have\Ntaken this job after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.28,0:18:10.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What good will this do?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.88,0:18:12.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These two are useless.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.72,0:18:13.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.06,0:18:15.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just enjoy them.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.00,0:18:17.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, you've got bad taste.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.14,0:18:21.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sick and twisted, but\Nactually I kind of like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.08,0:18:24.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They did say he was the\Nworst kind of womanizer.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.80,0:18:27.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now is not the time to remind me of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.48,0:18:33.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to know what you prefer, ladies.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.06,0:18:37.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pleasure before death, or\Njust death without pleasure?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.34,0:18:49.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boss, we've got a big\Nproblem! I'm busy! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.06,0:18:53.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But actually, it's me with\Nthe big roll over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.36,0:18:55.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hit him back!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.74,0:18:59.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Got you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.72,0:19:02.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.94,0:19:06.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm all looking for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.06,0:19:09.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's Vash the Stampede!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.30,0:19:15.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.36,0:19:16.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where'd he go?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.84,0:19:17.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.75,0:19:18.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To the potty, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.98,0:19:23.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He did save our lives!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.22,0:19:29.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right. Hold
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.28,0:19:36.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.12,0:19:37.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.52,0:19:41.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, Vash, it's time to\Nchoose your way to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.06,0:19:45.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Buy a boomerang or do a\Nsuicide dive off a cliff.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.00,0:19:46.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Suicide?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.22,0:19:52.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To tell you the truth, I disapprove\Nof suicide more than anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.96,0:19:55.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alright, the boomerang it is! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.50,0:19:57.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.96,0:20:09.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.24,0:20:16.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.15,0:20:18.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dangerous toys are fun,\Nbut you couldn't get hurt!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.64,0:20:31.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He got the boss!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.60,0:20:33.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That guy isn't human!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.34,0:20:39.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What fragile bonds of loyalty.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.96,0:20:40.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now you there!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.46,0:20:42.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You better look out!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.98,0:20:44.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.02,0:20:48.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just a little too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.22,0:20:54.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, friends, I really\Nhope you feel better.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.76,0:20:58.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.70,0:21:01.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They actually got both of\Nthem in a matter of minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.58,0:21:04.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's as if he were Vash the Stampede, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.00,0:21:10.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, did I work off the donuts\Nand the ten double dollars?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.36,0:21:11.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.68,0:21:16.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't be him.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.60,0:21:17.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's just no way.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.78,0:21:35.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Disaster report.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.02,0:21:41.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have determined that the landslide\Nwhich destroyed Felnarl was a
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.60,0:21:46.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,direct result of the illegal use of\Nexplosives by a man called Loose Ruth.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.48,0:21:50.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please pay all insurance\Nclaims as per regulations.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.60,0:21:55.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After all that work, we're at\Nless than zero on our Vash hunt.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.04,0:21:58.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But we can't just ignore the rumors.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.52,0:22:00.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is going to be difficult.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.88,0:22:02.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What about that crazy guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.20,0:22:04.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.11,0:22:05.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He couldn't possibly be Vash.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.82,0:22:07.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just don't buy that.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.14,0:22:07.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.84,0:22:10.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vash the Stampede?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.24,0:22:11.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yep, that's the one.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.98,0:22:15.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The man with 60 billion\Ndouble dollars on his head.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.42,0:22:17.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They say he showed up in Felnar.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.44,0:22:18.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Didn't you hear about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.66,0:22:20.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nope, so what happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.26,0:22:23.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Funny thing is, they say nobody died.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.34,0:22:27.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mean like you don't\Nneed God for a miracle?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.78,0:22:44.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.64,0:23:07.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I'll just leave my eyes
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.22,0:23:15.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll just leave my eyes
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.36,0:23:19.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With my
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.60,0:23:23.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,eyes and eyes
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.22,0:23:27.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll just
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.70,0:23:31.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,leave my eyes
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.24,0:23:36.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll see you
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.32,0:23:42.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.40,0:24:11.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's something that\Ncannot be expressed in words.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.12,0:24:12.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Human emotion.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.94,0:24:15.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Emotions of the heart can't\Njust be tucked away in a closet.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.92,0:24:17.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's a way to know the emotions.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.12,0:24:19.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look into the eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.98,0:24:21.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The girl lied to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.68,0:24:22.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I believed her.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.32,0:24:24.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The gentleman lied to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.78,0:24:25.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When I trusted him.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.44,0:24:27.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But the moment I looked into his eyes,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.06,0:24:30.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the angel of destiny began\Nto unravel the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.30,0:24:34.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just looking at their eyes,\Nthere is only one truth.

